So `object_t` from the pool starts zeroed: `head=0`, `tail=0`, `links` vector is zeroed (empty), `next=0`.

Then in `push()`:
```cpp
obj->head = head;
obj->tail = tail;
obj->next = current;
current = obj;
```

So the object is set up properly.

